pct-move-volume-snapshots (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaged release of the prototype.
  * Patch 1 (mounting snapshots of path-backed subvolumes) dropped in favour of
    depending on pve-lxc-snapshot-mount, which owns that fix. It was never
    specific to this feature - it repairs the same gap for btrfs generally -
    and pve-bcachefs carried a duplicate of it too.

